# Database & SQL

- **ALWAYS** read `database/schema.sql` before writing queries — never invent column/table names
- Schema changes only via `database/migrations/YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS_description.sql` (TiDB Cloud Serverless / MySQL 8 compatible)
- After applying a migration, **update `database/schema.sql`** to reflect the new structure
- Connection: `.env` (`DB_HOST`, `DB_PORT`, `DB_USER`, `DB_PASSWORD`, `DB_NAME`)
- mysql CLI must use `--ssl-mode=REQUIRED --protocol=TCP`
- Keep TypeScript types in `shared/`, `api/index.ts`, and client in sync with schema
